{"shortDescription":"TORONTO, Canada, Sept. 03, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Canadian General Investments, Limited (CGI) TSX:CGI LSE:CGI reports on an unaudited basis that its net asset value per share (NAV) at August 31, 2026 was $88.50 resulting in year-to-date and 12-month NAV returns, with dividends reinvested, of 10.9…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["TORONTO, Canada, Sept. 03, 2026 ",{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://www.globenewswire.com","linkText":"(GLOBE NEWSWIRE)"}}," -- Canadian General Investments, Limited (CGI) ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"TSX:CGI","text":"TSX:CGI"}}," ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"LSE:CGI","text":"LSE:CGI"}}," reports on an unaudited basis that its net asset value per share (NAV) at August 31, 2026 was $88.50 resulting in year-to-date and 12-month NAV returns, with dividends reinvested, of 10.9% and 17.0%, respectively. These compare with the 16.0% and 29.9% returns of the benchmark S\u0026P/TSX Composite Index on a total return basis for the same periods."]},{"type":"p","children":["The Company employs a leveraging strategy, by way of bank borrowing, with the intent to enhance returns to common shareholders. As at August 31, 2026, the leverage represented 12.2% of CGI’s net assets, up from 11.9% at the end of 2025 and down from 12.5% at August 31, 2025."]},{"type":"p","children":["The closing price for CGI’s common shares at August 31, 2026 was $53.43, resulting in year-to-date and 12-month share price returns, with dividends reinvested, of 15.1% and 29.2%, respectively."]},{"type":"p","children":["The sector weightings of CGI’s investment portfolio at market as of August 31, 2026 were as follows:"]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["Industrials"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["20.3"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["%"]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"t